WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.590
So Donald Trump has become completely obsessed
with democratic presidential candidate Michael

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:05.590
Bloomberg.

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:06.590
And it's starting to get weird.

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:07.820
And we've been covering this for a little
bit.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:12.059
For the last several weeks, Donald Trump has
seemed sort of triggered by Michael Bloomberg,

00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:13.059
Michael [inaudible]

00:00:13.059 --> 00:00:17.210
Bloomberg, putting out an ad about Trump's
golfing in which he used some, uh, unflattering

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:23.099
pictures of Donald Trump, Donald Trump, uh,
looking, uh, obese in the pictures that Michael

00:00:23.099 --> 00:00:24.700
Bloomberg's ad used.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:30.390
And Trump very much didn't like it and the
last 24 hours have seen Donald Trump devote

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.690
other than time devoted to pardoning people
convicted of various types of corruption.

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:39.829
Trump has devoted a lot of the last 24 hours
to tweeting and sharing videos and doctored

00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:41.789
images of Michael Bloomberg.

00:00:41.789 --> 00:00:48.199
His Twitter feed is simply riddled with the
stuff and Trump is becoming privately obsessed

00:00:48.199 --> 00:00:49.480
with Michael Bloomberg.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:54.690
Michael Bloomberg of course, will be debating
tonight his first debate in the democratic

00:00:54.690 --> 00:01:00.270
primary and we will see whether the stop and
frisk stuff comes up or the leaked or publicized

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:01.270
audio.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:07.930
We don't know, but what is very clear is that
Donald Trump is extremely distraught and obsessed

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:09.030
with Michael Bloomberg.

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:14.020
This started yesterday with another one of
his many Mike Bloomberg rants were Donald

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:20.340
Trump said, quote, what many Mike is doing
is nothing less than a large scale illegal

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:22.330
campaign contribution.

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:27.090
He is spreading money all over the place,
only to have recipients of his cash payments.

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:31.409
Many former opponents happily joining or supporting
his campaign.

00:01:31.409 --> 00:01:33.290
Isn't that called a pay off?

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:36.399
Many is illegally buying the Democrat nomination.

00:01:36.399 --> 00:01:38.120
They are taking it away from Bernie.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:41.829
Again, many Mike major party nominations are
not for sale.

00:01:41.829 --> 00:01:43.490
Good luck in the debate tomorrow night.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:47.020
And remember, no standing on boxes.

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:51.689
The standing on boxes thing is funny, but
consider the hypocrisy here that when Donald

00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:57.329
Trump ran in 2016 Trump bragged about how
he was funding his own campaign.

00:01:57.329 --> 00:02:00.299
He was rich, he's got money, he's funding
his own campaign.

00:02:00.299 --> 00:02:03.560
So he's immune from the demands of donors.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:07.520
And now Michael Bloomberg is funding his own
campaign and Trump says it's illegal.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:11.110
You can be for or against the system of campaign
finance that we have.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:12.820
I'm against it vociferously.

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:18.500
So, but Donald Trump is criticizing Michael
Bloomberg for doing exactly the same thing

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:21.710
that he did in 2016 the difference is Bloomberg
has way more money.

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:25.270
That's quite frankly, the real difference
between Trump and Bloomberg and it seems to

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.390
be very triggering to Donald Trump.

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:32.580
Now, after this, Michael Bloomberg tweeted
to Trump, why do you want to run against Bernie

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:33.800
so badly?

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:36.330
To which Donald Trump replied many.

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:40.770
Mike, no, I would rather run against you.

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:47.410
At this point, Trump switched from tweeting
words about Mike Bloomberg to re tweeting

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:51.320
doctored images and fake videos of Bloomberg.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:58.250
This is the president and he's spending his
day retweaking memes and videos of a possible

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:04.410
upcoming political opponent starting by re-tweeting
a picture of Michael Bloomberg's head, photo-shopped

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:08.970
onto a little kid's body on a debate stage
next to all the other candidates.

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:12.350
Again, going on this idea that Michael Bloomberg
is, is short.

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:18.770
Um, and then slightly later in the day re-tweeting
a video of Michael Bloomberg doctored to look

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:24.550
like Bloomberg isn't tall enough to see over
a lectern while speaking in public somewhere

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:28.600
unclear if Trump has realized that this was
a doctored video.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.560
I don't know that they actually care.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:36.240
Why do you think that Trump has become so
obsessed with Michael Bloomberg?

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:39.610
Is it that Bloomberg is so much richer than
Donald Trump?

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:44.830
Is that, that Bloomberg is actually spending
his own money and his ad spend is pushing

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:50.130
Trump to have to think about spending way
more than he wants to and probably isn't actually

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:51.530
interested in doing?

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:53.700
Is it a New York rivalry?

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:54.700
Bloomberg and Trump.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:59.090
Trump, the New York businessman of Bloomberg,
the former New York, a city mayor.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:03.400
Is it that Bloomberg is more successful as
a business person than Trump and doesn't have

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.030
the multiple bankruptcies?

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:06.080
I don't know what the answer is.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.420
I'm not a Bloomberg supporter.

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:12.870
I'm not defending Bloomberg in any way, but
what I want to understand, understand is why

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:18.620
is it that Donald Trump, Trump has become
obsessed with Michael Bloomberg, triggered

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:25.040
by every new ad that Michael Bloomberg puts
out there and focused so heavily on Michael

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.040
Bloomberg.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.040
Let me know what you think.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:28.040
I'm thinking out loud here.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:05:24.880
I don't know the answer, but I want to hear
from you.

